t the Natural Order must be destroyed.\n</p><p><br>\n3. The Emerald Enclave must offer aid to the weary and injured.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1780/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32132/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7901/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931949/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.545      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.545      1 -total\n 57.85%   25.192      8 Template:Icon_text\n 51.35%   22.362     19 Template:Trim\n 23.40%   10.188      2 Template:Uid\n 15.18%    6.612      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.58%    6.348      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.48%    5.868      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.95%    4.334      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.90%    4.313      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12595-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714222842 and revision id 343773. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}